{#
  Block         card-grid
  Role          Catalogue — the pages under one section
  Kind          section (drop-in, used more than once per page)
  Surface       light, bordered table grid
  Motion        reveal stagger (data-delay 0,1,2 per row)
  Anchor        cardsId
  Styles        src/css/home.css

  Set these before including, since a Nunjucks include shares the page's
  context and this block appears twice on the home page:

    cardsId          the section anchor
    cardsEyebrow     the small label above the heading
    cardsTitleLine1  heading, before the emphasised words
    cardsTitleEm     heading, the emphasised words
    cardsTitleLine2  heading, after the emphasised words (may be empty)
    cardsLinkLabel   the arrow link in the section head
    cardsLinkUrl     where that arrow link goes
    cardsItems       the pages to card, from `childrenOf`
    cardsCta         the per-card link label

  Copied from   branding/_original.com/blocks/catalogue/card-grid.njk at repo
                version 0.2.2, with the card list rewritten:

                1. The seven hand-written cards are a loop. The library block
                   fixes the count at seven through the bundle keys c1..c7 and
                   the literal "01 / 07" labels; the content tree decides the
                   count here, and the labels count themselves.
                2. A card links to the page it describes. Every card in the
                   library block links to `site.contact.whatsapp`, which is
                   undefined for a client whose site.yaml declares no whatsapp
                   entry and renders as href="".
                3. Title and text come from the page's own `title` and
                   `description`, so a card cannot fall out of step with the
                   page it points at.
                4. The .s-card--wide seventh card is dropped. It existed to
                   close a row of seven in a three-column grid; a loop of any
                   length has no seventh card to special-case.
#}
    <!-- ============ {{ cardsId | upper }} ============ -->
    <section class="sec services" id="{{ cardsId }}">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="sec-head">
          <div class="sec-head__main">
            <span class="eyebrow reveal">{{ cardsEyebrow | safe }}</span>
            <h2 class="section-title reveal" data-delay="1">{{ cardsTitleLine1 | safe }} <em>{{ cardsTitleEm | safe }}</em> {{ cardsTitleLine2 | safe }}</h2>
          </div>
{% if cardsLinkUrl %}          <a href="{{ cardsLinkUrl }}" class="link-arrow reveal" data-delay="1">{{ cardsLinkLabel | safe }} <span>&rarr;</span></a>
{% endif %}        </div>

        <div class="grid-table">
          <div class="services__grid">
{% for item in cardsItems %}            <article class="s-card reveal"{% if loop.index0 % 3 %} data-delay="{{ loop.index0 % 3 }}"{% endif %}>
              <span class="s-card__no">{% if loop.index < 10 %}0{% endif %}{{ loop.index }} / {% if cardsItems.length < 10 %}0{% endif %}{{ cardsItems.length }}</span>
              <h3>{{ item.data.title | safe }}</h3>
              <p>{{ item.data.description | safe }}</p>
              <a href="{{ item.url }}" class="s-card__link">{{ cardsCta | safe }} <span>&rarr;</span></a>
            </article>
{% endfor %}          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
